            <div xml:id="d1822">

                <pb facs="1190" n="1074" xml:id="pg1074"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 871.001F37/3.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Vopicka.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 35.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 23, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department acknowledges the receipt of
                    your despatch No. 143, Roumanian Series, of October 24 last, enclosing a letter
                    addressed to the President by His Majesty Ferdinand in which he announced the
                    death on October 10, 1914, of His Majesty Carol I and his accession to the
                    throne of Roumania.</p>
                <p>The Department encloses herewith, with office copy, a letter addressed by the
                    President to His Majesty Ferdinand, King of Roumania, acknowledging the letter
                    transmitted with your despatch of the 24th of October.</p>
                <p>You will forward the copy to the Foreign Office and deliver the original in the
                    manner most agreeable to His Majesty.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d1822-a1.xml" xpointer="d1822-a1"/>
            </div>
